{"chunks": [{"s": 0.15, "e": 2.912, "text": "The women here are really beautiful,"}, {"s": 3.269, "e": 4.831, "text": "that's no joke;"}, {"s": 5.188, "e": 6.902, "text": "the Arles museum,"}, {"s": 7.055, "e": 8.694, "text": "on the other hand,"}, {"s": 8.847, "e": 11.04, "text": "is dreadful and a joke,"}, {"s": 11.397, "e": 13.379, "text": "fit to be in Tarascon."}]}